# The sweep seeds River.epub into the simulator's library. Books opens it,
# turns two pages, sets the text larger, closes it and opens it again: the
# book has to come back on the same page at the same size.
wait-for River
expect-missing No books yet
expect-missing could not be read
shot books-shelf
tap River
wait-for Marker 1
tap-id reader-forward
wait-idle
tap-id reader-forward
wait-idle
expect-missing Marker 1
tap-id reader-controls
wait-for 100%
# The plus of the size stepper names the next size, Medium (wire value 5).
tap-id reader-size-5
wait-for 110%
shot books-larger
# Back closes the book from the open panel, and the home screen offers it
# again with Continue reading.
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for Continue reading
shot books-closed
tap Continue reading
wait-idle 1500
expect-missing Marker 1
tap-id reader-controls
wait-for 110%
shot books-reopened
